\"/w/images/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Hit_points\" title=\"Hit points\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">Hit Points</span></a> instead. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p><i>(Information not yet added.)</i>\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715100346\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.044 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.049 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 739/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 5737/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1803/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 21/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1601/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.018/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 843767/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   44.066      1 -total\n 51.67%   22.768      1 Template:Inaccessible\n 50.91%   22.433      1 Template:Inaccessible/internal\n 49.29%   21.718      1 Template:Ambox\n 48.25%   21.263      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n 11.50%    5.066      1 Template:DamageText\n  9.40%    4.141      1 Template:Passive_weapons_list\n  8.89%    3.918      1 Template:Damage_type\n  8.06%    3.550      1 Template:Icon_link\n  7.83%    3.449      1 Template:PageSeo\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:47393-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715100346 and revision id 243145. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}